  (polyline (pts (xy 248.00 220.00) (xy 408.00 220.00) (xy 408.00 258.00) (xy 248.00 258.00) (xy 248.00 220.00)) (stroke (width 0.3) (type default)) (uuid "eeefa187-5211-5e3e-bc4e-db141a6efa1d"))
  (text "(1) S4 and S5 are OPEN limit switches, article VC-CT-6200. S6 is an IDEC HE1B-M1.\n(2) OPEN: the index sensor order code is not chosen. The symbol is PNP.\n(3) S14 to S17 are lift limit contacts. The order code is not chosen.\n(4) X7 is the field terminal strip. The purchased block is not chosen.\n(5) DIO channel names are not a confirmed plug order. Confirm them on the Kunbus drawing.\nNets that leave this sheet are listed on the notes sheet." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 249.60 221.40 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "98621875-b393-5dfa-a882-8d86c1ab861d"))
